<span id="A2.T5.2.11.6.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A2.T5.2.11.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Given a reference image and a text modification, retrieve the image that best matches the modified reference.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T5.2.12" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T5.2.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle" style="padding:0.4pt 4.0pt;"></td>
<td id="A2.T5.2.12.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:0.4pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T5.2.12.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A2.T5.2.12.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Visual Puzzle</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A2.T5.2.12.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:0.4pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T5.2.12.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:56.9pt;">
<span id="A2.T5.2.12.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><math id="A2.T5.m31" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q_{i}\!\to\!c_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.108em" rspace="0.108em" stretchy="false">→</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q_{i}\!\to\!c_{i}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A2.T5.2.12.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding:0.4pt 4.0pt;"><math id="A2.T5.m32" class="ltx_Math" alttext="160" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>160</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">160</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A2.T5.2.12.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding:0.4pt 4.0pt;"><math id="A2.T5.m33" class="ltx_Math" alttext="5,375" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>375</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">5,375</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A2.T5.2.12.6" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding:0.4pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T5.2.12.6.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T5.2.12.6.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A2.T5.2.12.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">From a 3×3 grid with one missing cell, retrieve the best candidate image to complete the bottom-right cell based on patterns and relations.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T5.2.13" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T5.2.13.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_bb" style="padding:0.4pt 4.0pt;"></td>
